WEBVTT

00:02.940 --> 00:05.160
With supplies being limited,

00:05.160 --> 00:09.090
we'll need to add a rule allowing
passage in and out of the Colony.

00:09.700 --> 00:11.800
But I can't afford to
let Players like Dhruv,

00:11.800 --> 00:16.250
who attack people indiscriminately,
to leave the barriers.

00:16.740 --> 00:18.540
So that will have to come after

00:18.540 --> 00:21.430
eliminating all Players like him
from the other Colonies, too.

00:21.430 --> 00:23.680
So communication between
Colonies is a necessity.

00:23.560 --> 00:33.220
1: Transfer Points

00:23.560 --> 00:33.220
2: Escape From
the Culling Game

00:23.560 --> 00:33.220
3: Passage In and
Out of Colonies

00:23.560 --> 00:33.220
4: Communication In
and Out of Colonies

00:24.370 --> 00:26.670
So there are the two rules
Fushiguro-kun proposed:

00:26.670 --> 00:29.300
a means of communication,
and passage in and out of the Colonies.

00:29.300 --> 00:33.050
That means we'll need four additional
rules to get this situation under control.

00:33.620 --> 00:35.590
Everyone's worn out from Shibuya, too.

00:35.590 --> 00:37.820
They're at their limit,
physically and emotionally.

00:39.390 --> 00:40.750
Sensei...

00:41.560 --> 00:44.930
I won't let you kill
your best friend twice.

00:45.550 --> 00:47.540
I'll be the one to kill Kenjaku.

00:47.540 --> 00:49.900
I'll obtain 400 points on my own.

00:49.900 --> 00:52.900
JUJUTSU KAISEN

00:56.670 --> 00:59.010
It's okay to come out now.

00:59.010 --> 01:02.610
Let's continue making our way
north to the edge of the barrier.

01:02.610 --> 01:04.430
Carry me.

01:04.430 --> 01:05.490
Hang in there, okay?

01:06.340 --> 01:08.300
Let's take a short break.

01:08.300 --> 01:12.680
This stadium was controlled by the
powerful sorcerer I just defeated.

01:12.680 --> 01:16.250
People will be hesitant to
approach it for a while yet.

01:15.250 --> 01:16.520
What's that sound?!

01:20.910 --> 01:23.260
Run into the stadium.

01:25.620 --> 01:26.520
Hurry.

01:33.910 --> 01:35.070
H-Help!

01:40.550 --> 01:43.040
Are these cockroaches real?!

01:44.930 --> 01:45.540
Damn it!

01:52.010 --> 01:53.510
Rika! Knock it down!

01:53.510 --> 01:54.450
Hurry!

01:55.540 --> 01:57.040
Okay!

02:10.700 --> 02:13.020
Kogane, is that a Player?

02:14.140 --> 02:16.860
Yeah. It's called Kurourushi.

02:17.940 --> 02:20.390
So some Players are cursed spirits, too?

02:21.490 --> 02:24.490
Episode 59
Sendai Colony

02:27.710 --> 02:29.710
Festering Life Sword

02:47.860 --> 02:49.150
I'm being watched.

02:49.750 --> 02:53.110
Likely by the other two
Players with high points.

02:53.110 --> 02:55.530
Why do you interfere?

02:55.530 --> 02:57.310
Kurourushi is a cursed spirit.

02:57.680 --> 03:00.770
Why do you kill us?

03:00.770 --> 03:02.280
I can exorcise it for certain

03:02.280 --> 03:07.200
if I drive positive energy from my
reverse cursed technique into its body.

03:07.850 --> 03:09.790
That's what I'd like to know.

03:10.250 --> 03:11.090
However...

03:11.310 --> 03:14.770
I like the taste of iron!

03:17.890 --> 03:22.550
I don't want those other two to know
I can use the reverse cursed technique.

03:22.550 --> 03:25.290
And Rika is protecting
everyone in the stadium.

03:25.290 --> 03:29.020
I want to exorcise Kurourushi without
using Rika or my reverse cursed technique.

03:35.360 --> 03:39.020
Blinding, blinding, blinding...

04:51.780 --> 04:54.340
You have earned five points.

04:54.340 --> 04:56.310
I see you can use...

04:56.950 --> 04:58.440
reverse cursed technique.

05:06.300 --> 05:08.040
What was that?

05:08.040 --> 05:08.790
A strike?

05:19.110 --> 05:20.760
My arm is back to normal.

05:20.760 --> 05:22.120
Nothing's off.

05:22.120 --> 05:25.170
Her technique probably manipulates space.

05:25.170 --> 05:28.410
But I guess it can't crush her
opponent along with said space.

05:28.410 --> 05:31.890
It feels like it's creating errors similar
to the distortions from a lens.

05:32.190 --> 05:36.520
My technique treats the
"sky" as a "surface."

05:38.380 --> 05:39.710
Like this.

05:40.340 --> 05:42.110
She's revealing her technique!

05:42.730 --> 05:44.810
Hurry up and attack.

05:45.390 --> 05:47.750
I'll go ahead and ask...

05:47.750 --> 05:50.390
You're someone who won't complain
about getting killed, right?

05:50.390 --> 05:53.590
I can understand powerless people
getting desperate for points,

05:53.590 --> 05:57.430
but a strong person like you can
claim points whenever they want.

05:57.430 --> 06:00.250
So what's your reason for
actively seeking a fight?

06:00.580 --> 06:01.870
This little...

06:02.290 --> 06:06.800
What, are sorcerers of this age
that casual about incarnation?

06:06.800 --> 06:10.300
To us, this means coming
back from the dead!

06:10.720 --> 06:13.290
People who lived out
their lives without regrets

06:13.290 --> 06:15.720
wouldn't accept Kenjaku's
offer, would they?

06:16.160 --> 06:17.860
He pisses me off.

06:18.230 --> 06:22.370
The Culling Game is just the first step
toward a chance at a second life.

06:22.770 --> 06:25.980
Keep in mind, Kenjaku
set the stage for this.

06:25.980 --> 06:29.550
We should be earning points to prepare
for anything that could happen.

06:30.220 --> 06:32.940
Do you not have any friends or lovers?

06:35.070 --> 06:35.980
Huh?

06:36.800 --> 06:40.280
I didn't have any friends
until recently either,

06:40.280 --> 06:42.220
but I can't empathize with that.

06:42.220 --> 06:44.650
Yeah. This feeling.

06:44.650 --> 06:47.410
It's like he's tracing my trigger.

06:48.130 --> 06:49.840
Even if you had regrets,

06:49.840 --> 06:52.470
you're killing people hundreds—
thousands—of years removed from then.

06:52.840 --> 06:55.960
How can you be so desperate
for your own sake?

06:55.960 --> 07:00.230
Are you... one of the Fujiwara?!

07:00.720 --> 07:04.270
What would anyone from your
bloodline understand?!

07:14.340 --> 07:15.860
Granite Blast.

07:25.590 --> 07:27.040
Ishigori?

07:27.390 --> 07:29.060
That rooftop?

07:29.060 --> 07:31.050
He's rather close.

07:31.290 --> 07:34.930
Even with Rika protecting
the people in the stadium,

07:34.930 --> 07:38.530
a direct hit from an attack on that
level would cause several to die.

07:38.530 --> 07:39.810
So first, I'll take Ishigori...

07:40.370 --> 07:45.220
Now that Kurourushi and Dhruv are gone,
I have no reason to let Ishigori run free.

07:45.760 --> 07:47.470
I'll take both him and Okkotsu...

07:47.470 --> 07:48.520
...out!

07:47.470 --> 07:48.520
...out!

07:50.330 --> 07:52.490
Granite Blast!

08:05.120 --> 08:08.380
Come on, don't disappoint me.

08:10.380 --> 08:11.530
He's gone?

08:11.530 --> 08:14.770
Right! That's where Okkotsu
dug a hole earlier!

08:19.210 --> 08:21.860
Please fight a little more discreetly.

08:21.860 --> 08:25.940
Will that sate the hunger, Okkotsu?

08:26.150 --> 08:28.940
JUJUTSU KAISEN

08:30.160 --> 08:33.110
Would you tell a kid with
a feast before him

08:33.110 --> 08:36.060
to slow down and take his time eating?

08:37.410 --> 08:39.300
Wouldn't anyone?

08:40.090 --> 08:43.150
Right. Most probably would.

08:43.150 --> 08:44.740
That was a bad example.

08:45.280 --> 08:49.300
My first run at life was
moderately filling.

08:49.930 --> 08:52.380
I fought some guys with real backbone.

08:52.380 --> 08:54.480
I met a nice woman, too.

08:54.960 --> 08:59.230
Frankly, it would be hard
to say I had any regrets.

09:00.820 --> 09:05.940
This vague hunger is the most
annoying kind, Okkotsu.

09:05.940 --> 09:07.130
Everyone looks at me with

09:07.130 --> 09:09.460
"What are you unsatisfied about?"
on their face.

09:11.730 --> 09:15.410
Did you know these cigarettes have
a slightly sweet aftertaste?

09:16.990 --> 09:21.210
There was no dessert in my life.

09:22.070 --> 09:23.210
Here it comes!

09:31.450 --> 09:33.670
Why am I unsatisfied?!

09:34.470 --> 09:36.370
I think you know!

09:43.750 --> 09:46.730
I'm unsatisfied because
I'm not fulfilled!

10:01.220 --> 10:03.500
You'd better not be crushed!

10:04.750 --> 10:05.880
Whoa.

10:19.830 --> 10:21.060
That hurt.

10:38.430 --> 10:39.060
Good.

10:46.040 --> 10:48.170
Not calling your shikigami?

10:49.690 --> 10:51.090
I can't.

10:51.690 --> 10:53.670
Not with you going wild.

10:53.890 --> 10:55.850
That's a shame.

10:58.740 --> 11:00.970
He's probably trying to limit my paths,

11:02.150 --> 11:03.730
but I'll break through...

11:04.940 --> 11:06.190
head-on!

11:07.350 --> 11:08.680
Sweet!

11:08.680 --> 11:10.360
That's it, Okkotsu!

11:10.360 --> 11:11.640
In that case...

11:14.550 --> 11:16.320
His cursed energy is more precise!

11:16.320 --> 11:17.100
This is bad!

11:22.290 --> 11:24.460
Well done! Here's a reward!

11:28.550 --> 11:30.030
Whoops.

11:30.030 --> 11:32.090
I overheated.

11:40.730 --> 11:42.480
You're good, Okkotsu!

11:42.970 --> 11:46.350
Are you my dessert?!

11:53.490 --> 11:56.870
You are the best!

12:01.490 --> 12:03.360
What I strike isn't the person,

12:03.710 --> 12:05.500
but the surface of the "sky."

12:07.420 --> 12:08.960
Thin Ice Breaker!

12:12.190 --> 12:15.040
Out of our way, you pile of vomit!

12:17.620 --> 12:20.390
Can it, dick cheese!

12:26.690 --> 12:28.500
You're resilient.

12:28.500 --> 12:29.670
That's fine.

12:29.670 --> 12:32.060
I decided to torment you anyway.

12:33.640 --> 12:35.040
That packed a punch.

12:35.040 --> 12:38.280
That's my first time
eating my own technique.

12:38.910 --> 12:41.370
Reverse cursed technique
is a pain to deal with,

12:41.370 --> 12:43.660
but it burns cursed energy like crazy.

12:45.930 --> 12:49.860
We're finally seeing the bottom
of your reserves, Okkotsu.

12:50.230 --> 12:52.870
No matter how delicious
or high-end the shop is,

12:52.870 --> 12:55.020
seeing the displays empty
close to closing time

12:55.020 --> 12:56.720
is always disappointing.

12:58.090 --> 12:59.980
I guess it wasn't you.

13:05.750 --> 13:10.000
I wanted to gain more distance
from everyone in the stadium.

13:10.000 --> 13:11.270
Oh, well.

13:16.340 --> 13:18.180
Come here, Rika.

13:19.250 --> 13:20.400
Give me everything.

13:23.510 --> 13:26.020
His shikigami completely manifested?!

13:26.020 --> 13:27.770
How does that work?

13:27.770 --> 13:30.390
He's swelling with
cursed energy again, too!

13:30.890 --> 13:33.920
Yuta, which would you like?

13:33.920 --> 13:35.480
Thank you.

13:35.480 --> 13:36.700
I'll take that one.

13:38.810 --> 13:41.700
"Rika" is the stockpile of cursed energy

13:41.700 --> 13:43.790
and the externalization
of Okkotsu's technique

13:43.790 --> 13:46.560
that remained with him after
Rika Orimoto passed on.

13:46.710 --> 13:49.380
While connected to "Rika"
through the ring,

13:49.380 --> 13:51.970
he gains the following:
use of his cursed technique,

13:51.970 --> 13:53.650
the complete manifestation of "Rika,"

13:53.650 --> 13:56.980
and cursed energy supplied by "Rika."

13:58.070 --> 14:02.120
He can remain connected for five minutes.

14:04.260 --> 14:05.310
Okay.

14:05.800 --> 14:06.900
Let's go.

14:08.010 --> 14:09.220
Don't underestimate me!

14:13.910 --> 14:15.250
Don't move.

14:14.030 --> 14:15.450
Don't Move

14:15.830 --> 14:17.110
Snake eyes and fangs!

14:17.600 --> 14:18.700
I can't move!

14:23.910 --> 14:25.430
Hey, now.

14:25.660 --> 14:27.430
You're super sweet, aren't you?!

14:29.770 --> 14:30.810
Rika!

14:30.810 --> 14:31.350
Aye!

14:31.350 --> 14:32.310
Bring it!

14:33.800 --> 14:34.680
It's tough!

14:40.280 --> 14:41.770
That was close!

14:42.890 --> 14:45.350
Don't act like you've won!

15:14.690 --> 15:17.340
You!

15:17.340 --> 15:19.390
I won't forgive you!

15:29.820 --> 15:31.040
What?

15:31.370 --> 15:32.980
Let's go!

15:35.620 --> 15:36.400
Hell yeah!

15:37.270 --> 15:39.120
Even with this, I can't fully block it!

15:42.390 --> 15:43.550
Want a go?

16:12.680 --> 16:14.080
Thin Ice Breaker!

16:23.570 --> 16:24.420
Tsk!

16:24.790 --> 16:27.790
The Sun, Moon, and Stars Squad was
the Fujiwara Clan's personal squad of assassins.
We lived in darkness and served with selfless devotion.
We were even forbidden from having our own names.

16:28.880 --> 16:31.880
Yet that man once granted me a name.
So he could execute me instead
for his crime of slaying his own kin.

16:32.970 --> 16:34.710
Fujiwara!

16:35.470 --> 16:39.160
I've still got a strong appetite!

16:40.670 --> 16:42.520
Let's keep chowing down!

16:44.260 --> 16:45.880
It's always you, Fujiwara!

16:46.210 --> 16:48.520
You always get in my way!

16:48.520 --> 16:50.650
Are you that afraid of me?!

16:50.650 --> 16:53.410
Afraid of me becoming my own person?!

16:59.410 --> 17:02.990
Okkotsu had defeated Dhruv Lakdawalla,

17:03.490 --> 17:07.670
whose technique made the path of
his shikigami into his domain,

17:07.670 --> 17:10.980
which cut into anything it touched.

17:13.630 --> 17:16.660
This is... Dhruv's technique!

17:17.120 --> 17:20.260
Is Okkotsu's technique...

17:20.260 --> 17:21.350
Copy?!

17:34.120 --> 17:38.020
I don't know what my
ancestors did to you,

17:38.020 --> 17:42.420
but you'll eventually reach your limit
if you live solely for yourself.

17:42.790 --> 17:43.670
Shut up!

17:43.670 --> 17:46.010
"Live for the sake of others!"

17:46.010 --> 17:48.290
"There's no need to be your own person!"

17:49.570 --> 17:54.930
It's always the ones who already became
someone who bark things like that!

18:10.470 --> 18:12.140
Quit your annoying whining!

18:12.140 --> 18:13.810
At this point...

18:15.580 --> 18:17.620
words are unnecessary!

18:22.750 --> 18:24.500
Domain Expansion!

18:22.750 --> 18:24.500
Domain Expansion.

18:22.750 --> 18:24.500
Domain Expansion!

18:26.830 --> 18:29.960
Give me back Yuta!

18:29.960 --> 18:32.840
Even if it tries to penetrate
the barrier later...

18:33.030 --> 18:34.840
I'm not going to drag this out!

18:34.840 --> 18:37.290
Let's settle this nice and sweet!

18:39.170 --> 18:43.460
At that moment, the black
devil of the modern age...

18:43.460 --> 18:47.340
I like the taste of iron!

18:47.340 --> 18:49.390
...flew into the barriers.

18:52.390 --> 18:57.780
Kurourushi had completed parthenogenesis
before going dormant.

18:58.720 --> 19:02.600
So Kurourushi was still alive
and well as a cursed spirit.

19:03.160 --> 19:06.910
The complex forces of three domains
had been keeping them all in check.

19:07.800 --> 19:11.140
But this intruder was unexpected.

19:11.930 --> 19:13.500
And so the barriers

19:16.160 --> 19:18.000
collapsed.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.930
How is Kurourushi alive?!

19:30.270 --> 19:31.420
Damn it!

19:31.420 --> 19:34.010
I can't use my technique right
after Domain Expansion!

19:40.770 --> 19:42.790
How dare you take my arm?!

19:42.790 --> 19:44.340
Fujiwara!

19:44.340 --> 19:46.720
That's enough, Uro.

19:47.400 --> 19:50.290
You two aren't invited to this table.

19:52.300 --> 19:54.260
Granite Blast.

19:57.350 --> 20:01.180
Ishigori's technique is
Cursed Energy Discharge.

20:01.180 --> 20:05.840
It's an extremely simple attack,
but it performs just as well

20:05.840 --> 20:08.560
even when his technique is burnt out.

20:16.860 --> 20:17.910
Now,

20:21.220 --> 20:23.000
have a seat at our table,

20:24.760 --> 20:25.940
Okkotsu.

20:27.110 --> 20:28.880
Let's go, Rika.

20:33.900 --> 20:37.280
Okkotsu can discharge a high
volume of cursed energy

20:37.280 --> 20:40.760
only while Rika is completely manifested.

20:40.760 --> 20:44.920
However, his maximum output is
slightly inferior to Ishigori's.

20:46.180 --> 20:49.700
So he planned to charge and
unleash his cursed energy

20:49.700 --> 20:52.010
before Ishigori reached maximum output.

20:52.640 --> 20:54.440
At first.

20:55.350 --> 21:00.940
Let's let it all out!

20:57.590 --> 21:00.570
Four hundred years of longing.

21:00.570 --> 21:03.440
The intense gaze full of that hunger

21:03.780 --> 21:07.800
melted Yuta Okkotsu's heart,

21:07.800 --> 21:11.960
even though he would likely
never find meaning in fighting.

21:12.920 --> 21:14.950
Just this once.

21:33.640 --> 21:37.400
That was seriously sweet, Okkotsu!

21:47.500 --> 21:48.970
That's right!

21:48.970 --> 21:51.280
Let's keep going!

21:54.860 --> 21:57.140
That big thing can fire it on its own?!

21:57.700 --> 21:58.750
But...

21:59.760 --> 22:01.650
its force is weak!

22:03.160 --> 22:05.910
After Domain Expansion
and a meal with me,

22:06.760 --> 22:11.150
even you couldn't have
recovered that much.

22:11.480 --> 22:12.960
I'll settle this.

22:13.380 --> 22:15.750
Granite Blast!

22:20.390 --> 22:22.630
Okkotsu's technique

22:23.530 --> 22:25.750
had already recovered.

22:28.450 --> 22:30.340
Uro's technique?!

22:30.830 --> 22:33.590
I thought he was more than
just a cursed speech user!

22:33.590 --> 22:38.400
I figured that big thing probably had
a different technique from Okkotsu's,

22:38.400 --> 22:39.680
but I was wrong!

22:39.680 --> 22:42.030
Okkotsu's technique is Copy!

22:42.030 --> 22:43.850
But there should be strenuous
conditions on it!

22:43.850 --> 22:45.800
When?! When did he
satisfy those conditions?!

22:45.800 --> 22:47.050
While I wasn't looking?!

22:47.430 --> 22:49.430
Don't tell me there are no conditions?!

22:53.700 --> 22:55.430
That was when he did it!

22:55.980 --> 22:57.230
Thin Ice Breaker!

23:08.450 --> 23:09.560
Five minutes.

23:10.010 --> 23:13.110
Okkotsu's connection
to "Rika" was severed.

23:19.540 --> 23:21.720
Yuta!

23:24.900 --> 23:26.590
I had no idea...

23:30.330 --> 23:33.470
there was more after
wringing everything out!

23:36.320 --> 23:40.090
This is what dessert is like!

24:02.090 --> 24:03.610
Now we're done.

24:07.170 --> 24:08.030
What?!

24:08.800 --> 24:10.380
What is he after?!

24:27.210 --> 24:29.820
Was this mine?

24:32.640 --> 24:34.040
In that instant...

24:34.040 --> 24:37.860
he sent it sailing back to
me using Uro's technique?

24:41.050 --> 24:42.600
Thank you.

24:49.470 --> 24:51.460
I'm full.

25:09.320 --> 25:11.850
You're too soft, Okkotsu.

25:12.720 --> 25:14.710
I'm not praising you.

25:14.710 --> 25:16.960
Sparing the life of a sorcerer
who fought to kill you...

25:16.960 --> 25:19.700
There's nothing to gain from it.

25:19.700 --> 25:21.080
Uro-san told me the same thing.

25:21.470 --> 25:23.650
That woman's still alive?

25:25.210 --> 25:29.450
Well, I guess my blast was weaker
after my Domain Expansion.

25:29.800 --> 25:32.540
She kept going on about something.

25:32.540 --> 25:33.750
Were you having a lover's spat?

25:34.250 --> 25:35.790
Something like that.

25:36.350 --> 25:38.350
Don't look so annoyed by it.

25:38.350 --> 25:41.280
There's nothing I can say to that woman.

25:42.230 --> 25:44.840
Anything I say will lead to violence.

25:45.420 --> 25:47.620
Because I'm blessed.

25:48.790 --> 25:50.480
Is that how it works?

25:50.480 --> 25:52.420
I don't get it.

25:53.660 --> 25:55.230
Regardless,

25:55.690 --> 25:57.260
please give me your points.

26:00.270 --> 26:02.120
Now I get it.

26:02.120 --> 26:05.180
You would have killed us
if not for this, right?

26:06.960 --> 26:09.100
I'm not so sure.

26:11.720 --> 26:14.580
You should be grateful to my friends.

26:17.600 --> 26:20.840
Through the transfer of Ryu Ishigori
and Takako Uro's points,

26:21.100 --> 26:23.640
Yuta Okkotsu came to possess 190 points.

26:26.030 --> 26:29.110
You're the one who will
reach their limit.

26:32.660 --> 26:34.610
I've seen it.

26:38.210 --> 26:40.130
Be it sorcerer or cursed spirit,

26:40.350 --> 26:43.360
those who surpass the
bounds of being strong

26:44.610 --> 26:46.870
all have overwhelming egos.

26:47.210 --> 26:48.870
They don't concern themselves
with other things.

